{
  "id": "https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/litologia/roca-ignea-faneritica",
  "type": "Concept",
  "prefLabel": {
    "en": "phaneritic igneous rock",
    "es": "roca ígnea fanerítica"
  },
  "definition": {
    "en": "Igneous rock in which the framework of the rock consists of individual crystals that can be discerned with the unaided eye. bounding grain size is on the order of 32 to 100 microns. igneous rocks with 'exotic' composition are excluded from this concept.",
    "es": "Roca ígnea constituida por cristales que pueden distinguirse a simple vista. el tamaño de los granos es del orden de 32 a 100 micras. las rocas ígneas de composición poco habitual (exóticas) quedan excluidas de este concepto."
  },
